+domain: architecture
+strategy: systematic
+depth: deep
+proposals_target: 3
+handoff_target: design
+created: 2026-07-04
+standardized_inputs:
+  - docs/native-prep/00-seed-brief.md
+  - docs/native-prep/10-findings-and-evaluation.md
