+- **When the old king gets tired, I am a little worried — but only a little.** He just sits down for a
+  rest. Kind Éowyn helps him. That makes me feel better.
+- **The grumpy shadow is not a nightmare.** Éowyn is kind and the shadow smiles and goes home. The dark
+  room gets bright again when the windows open. I feel calm.
+- **The ending is happy and safe.** The city is still standing, the sun comes out, everyone hugs. I feel
+  good and safe.
+
